---
import SEOPage from "../layouts/SEOPage.astro";
---

<SEOPage
  title="Pengo Systems"
  description="Pengo Systems builds structural tools for observing, controlling, and reporting what AI systems actually do."
  url="https://pengosystems.com/"
>
  <main class="p-8">
    <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-wide text-gray-500">
        Pengo Systems
      </p>

      <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900">
        Stop waiting for AI to magically get better.
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-5 text-xl text-gray-700">
        Find the structure. Use it to observe, control, and report what AI systems
        actually do.
      </p>

      <p class="mt-5 text-lg text-gray-600">
        Pengo Systems builds structural tools for inspecting AI asks, visible
        failure surfaces, recurring patterns, diagnostic lenses, and the control
        surfaces needed to make AI behavior observable.
      </p>

      <section class="mt-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900">
          Current Public Surface
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-3 text-gray-700">
          The first public surface is the Pengo AI Structural Workbench: a
          practical inspection surface for finding where AI work loses structure.
        </p>

        <nav class="mt-6" aria-label="Primary">
          <ul class="space-y-3">
            <li>
              <a class="font-semibold text-blue-700 underline" href="/workbench/">
                Open the Pengo AI Structural Workbench
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a class="font-semibold text-blue-700 underline" href="/workbench/check-input/">
                Start with Check Input
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a class="font-semibold text-blue-700 underline" href="/workbench/search/">
                Search the Workbench
              </a>
            </li>
            <li>
              <a class="font-semibold text-blue-700 underline" href="/about/">
                About the Workbench
              </a>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </nav>
      </section>

      <section class="mt-10">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900">
          Direction
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-3 text-gray-700">
          The Workbench helps find and inspect structure. Future Pengo surfaces
          can use declared structure to observe, control, and report what AI
          systems actually do.
        </p>
      </section>
    </section>
  </main>
</SEOPage>